<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<UserControl
    x:Class="Phoenix.Controls.Hub.WinUI.Panels.AlertsPanel.AlertsView"
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
    xmlns:local="using:Phoenix.Controls.Hub.WinUI.Panels.AlertsPanel"
    xmlns:cmn="using:Phoenix.Controls.Hub.WinUI.Panels.Common"
    xmlns:loc="using:Phoenix.Controls.Hub.WinUI.Localization"
    HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
    VerticalAlignment="Stretch"
    HorizontalContentAlignment="Stretch"
    VerticalContentAlignment="Stretch"
    AutomationProperties.Name="Alerts page"
    AutomationProperties.HelpText="Event responses: pick an event family from the roster on the right, switch it on, and give it size tiers with a chat line and an optional overlay trigger."
    loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.page.a11y"
    loc:Localize.HelpTextKey="panel.alerts.page.help">

    <!--
        ══════════════════ THE HOUSE TOOL-PAGE SHELL ══════════════════

        Row 0  ToolPageHeader — the 48 px band: name · master switch · ONE state
               phrase · the page's single brass CTA.
        Row 1  two-column body: the detail column takes the star, the live column
               is a fixed 300 px. No ColumnSpacing — the right column's left
               border IS the divider.

               LEFT  *     the SELECTED event family — its enable, the raid-only
                           auto-shoutout, the token strip and its tier editor.
               RIGHT 300   the ten families as compact rows, plus the matching rule.

        ══ 2026-08-14 — the config-surface conversion ══
        Majo, on 1.1.9: the Pre-Build pages "are NOT conclusive ... additionally
        many of those panels are cluttered heavily with options". Measured on this
        page: 192 px of chrome sat above the first editable control, and three of
        the rows in that stack said the SAME thing — whether the tool is enabled —
        in three vocabularies (DISABLED chip · "DISABLED — the tool is dormant…"
        band · "dormant" pill). Four rows collapsed into one 48 px band:

          · the action strip (master chip · status pill · ADD TIER)  → the band
          · the pinned master-state banner (its VM text members are
            gone with it)                                            → the band
          · the ToolStatusPill instance                              → the band
          · the three-tile stat strip (0 / 0 / 0 on a fresh install) → DELETED

        The stat strip has no replacement. The one count worth a glance — how many
        families are armed — was already in the live column's own header
        (RosterCountText, "3 of 10 on"), which is where a count belongs.

        ★ THE PILL IS RE-HOMED, NOT REVOKED. AlertsService.PillState and its
        four-state predicate are untouched, as is PreBuildStatusPillTests; they
        carry the honesty audit (the Degraded caption names the seams the
        predicate actually gates, and no state claims a green light over a dead
        socket). What changed is only WHERE the result renders — the band's state
        phrase now, computed from the same StatusPillText the pill consumed.

        WHAT DID NOT CHANGE. Everything in the detail column moved across intact —
        family enable, raid auto-shoutout, the token/amount strip, the tier list
        with its per-tier enable / delete / from-size / message / layer / trigger /
        ↻ controls, the unreachable-tier warning and the per-card empty state.

        NO IsEnabled GATE ANYWHERE ON THIS PAGE. Nothing on the old page was gated
        on the master switch either, and adding a gate now would be a behaviour
        change dressed up as a layout change — a streamer configures tiers with the
        tool off all the time. The header's state phrase says what "off" means in
        words instead. (Corollary: none of the IsEnabled-on-a-Panel markup-compiler
        traps can bite here — the page now carries no IsEnabled binding at all.)

        NO ENTRANCE ANIMATION. the Pre-Builds rail already runs FadeSlideIn on every tool
        activation; the page-side entrance this file used to run was the second of
        two.
    -->

    <UserControl.Resources>
        <ResourceDictionary>
            <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
                <!-- KEPT, checked type by type: the page declares TextBox
                     (from-size, message) and ComboBox (the two editable layer /
                     trigger pickers) directly, and since the header-band
                     conversion its implicit ToggleSwitch style also reaches the
                     master switch inside ToolPageHeader (implicit-style lookup
                     walks up out of a nested UserControl). No CheckBox, no Pivot. -->
                <ResourceDictionary Source="ms-appx:///Panels/Common/ToolControlStyles.xaml" />
                <!-- Keyed-only shell styles. Never merged into App.xaml. -->
                <ResourceDictionary Source="ms-appx:///Panels/Common/ToolShellStyles.xaml" />
            </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>

            <!-- Tier mini-card nested inside the detail column's tier list. Padding 0
                 so the raised mini-band can run edge to edge; the house separation is
                 the opaque coal-card outline plus that band, never a second fill. -->
            <Style x:Key="AlTierCard" TargetType="Border">
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource CoalShellBrush}" />
                <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource CoalCardBrush}" />
                <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
                <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource Radius1Corner}" />
                <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
                <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,0,10" />
            </Style>

            <!-- ════════ One size tier, in the 1.4* detail column ════════
                 ItemsControl → ItemsRepeater host. Safe here: no code-behind walks
                 the visual tree for tier rows — delete / ↻ / drop-down-opened all
                 pattern-match the sender's DataContext, which ItemsRepeater
                 supplies exactly as ItemsControl did. -->
            <DataTemplate x:Key="TierRowTemplate" x:DataType="local:AlertTierRowVm">
                <Border Style="{StaticResource AlTierCard}">
                    <StackPanel>

                        <!-- Mini-band: FROM SIZE eyebrow + enable + delete. -->
                        <Border Background="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                                BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalCardBrush}"
                                BorderThickness="0,0,0,1"
                                Padding="12,6">
                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="0"
                                           Text="{x:Bind TitleEyebrow, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                <!-- ToggleSwitch → TogglePill in a borderless Button host.
                                     The Button owns the Click and the accessible name; the
                                     pill is display-only. -->
                                <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                        Padding="0,4,10,4"
                                        Background="Transparent"
                                        BorderThickness="0"
                                        CornerRadius="{StaticResource Radius1Corner}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        Click="OnToggleTierEnabledClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Tier enabled"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.tier.enabled.a11y">
                                    <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind Enabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                    Label="{x:Bind EnabledLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                </Button>
                                <Button Grid.Column="2"
                                        Style="{StaticResource ToolDangerButtonStyle}"
                                        Click="OnDeleteTierClick"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Delete tier"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.tier.delete.a11y">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                        <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE74D;" FontSize="11"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource ErrBrush}" />
                                        <TextBlock Text="DELETE" Style="{StaticResource ToolStripLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.tier.delete.label" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>

                        <!-- Tier settings body -->
                        <StackPanel Margin="12,10,12,12" Spacing="10">

                            <!-- From size -->
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <TextBlock Text="From size" Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.tier.from_size.label" />
                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind MinValueText, Mode=TwoWay}" Width="64"
                                         FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="11"
                                         TextAlignment="Right"
                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Minimum event size"
                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.tier.from_size.a11y" />
                                <TextBlock Text="(0 = catch-all)" Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.tier.from_size.hint" />
                            </StackPanel>

                            <!-- Passive reachability cue: the highest matching tier wins and
                                 ties resolve to the FIRST in list order, so a duplicate "From
                                 size" leaves this row dead. A muted whisper only — the value
                                 stays exactly as typed and the save is never blocked. -->
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                       Visibility="{x:Bind UnreachableVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                       Text="Unreachable — an earlier tier already starts at this size."
                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.tier.unreachable.hint" />

                            <!-- Message -->
                            <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                <TextBlock Text="Message" Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.tier.message.label" />
                                <TextBox Text="{x:Bind Message, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                         PlaceholderText="Thanks {user}!"
                                         AcceptsReturn="True"
                                         TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                         MinHeight="56"
                                         HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                         AutomationProperties.Name="Tier chat message"
                                         loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.alerts.tier.message.placeholder"
                                         loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.tier.message.a11y" />
                            </StackPanel>

                            <Border Height="1" Background="{StaticResource CoalCardBrush}" />

                            <!-- Overlay hookup: editable ComboBoxes (free entry via Text)
                                 fed lazily from the layer registry; ↻ re-reads both lists. -->
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="12">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                    <TextBlock Text="OVERLAY LAYER" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                               loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.tier.layer.label" />
                                    <ComboBox Width="200" IsEditable="True"
                                              FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="11"
                                              ItemsSource="{x:Bind LayerOptions, Mode=OneWay}"
                                              Text="{x:Bind LayerId, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                              PlaceholderText="(none)"
                                              DropDownOpened="OnLayerComboOpened"
                                              AutomationProperties.Name="Overlay layer id"
                                              loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.alerts.tier.layer.placeholder"
                                              loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.tier.layer.a11y" />
                                </StackPanel>
                                <StackPanel Spacing="3">
                                    <TextBlock Text="TRIGGER" Style="{StaticResource ToolSubLabelTextStyle}"
                                               loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.tier.trigger.label" />
                                    <ComboBox Width="200" IsEditable="True"
                                              FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="11"
                                              ItemsSource="{x:Bind TriggerOptions, Mode=OneWay}"
                                              Text="{x:Bind TriggerName, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                              PlaceholderText="(none)"
                                              DropDownOpened="OnTriggerComboOpened"
                                              AutomationProperties.Name="Overlay trigger name"
                                              loc:Localize.PlaceholderKey="panel.alerts.tier.trigger.placeholder"
                                              loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.tier.trigger.a11y" />
                                </StackPanel>
                                <Button Style="{StaticResource ToolSecondaryButtonStyle}"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                                        MinWidth="40" Padding="0"
                                        Click="OnRefreshLayersClick"
                                        ToolTipService.ToolTip="Reload the layer and trigger lists"
                                        AutomationProperties.Name="Refresh layer list"
                                        loc:Localize.TooltipKey="panel.alerts.tier.refresh.tip"
                                        loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.tier.refresh.a11y">
                                    <FontIcon FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" Glyph="&#xE72C;" FontSize="11"
                                              Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}" />
                                </Button>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                       Text="Optional — fires the trigger on every widget of the layer that owns it (Args1=KIND, Args2=USER, Args3=AMOUNT)."
                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.tier.overlay.hint" />

                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </DataTemplate>

            <!-- ════════ One event family, as a 0.9* roster row ════════
                 The enable pill stays a plain SIBLING of the row-select button,
                 never nested inside it — same rule the old header band followed, so
                 switching a family on never moves the selection.
                 Safe as an ItemsRepeater: the EventCard / EventBody visual-tree walk
                 that used to open a card body is gone with the collapsible card. -->
            <DataTemplate x:Key="EventRowTemplate" x:DataType="local:AlertEventVm">
                <Grid Padding="14,7"
                      ColumnSpacing="8"
                      Background="{x:Bind RowBackground, Mode=OneWay}"
                      BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                      BorderThickness="0,0,0,1">
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                    <Button Grid.Column="0"
                            Padding="0,4,4,4"
                            Background="Transparent"
                            BorderThickness="0"
                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource Radius1Corner}"
                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                            Click="OnToggleEventEnabledClick"
                            ToolTipService.ToolTip="Switch this event family on or off"
                            AutomationProperties.Name="{x:Bind Title}"
                            loc:Localize.TooltipKey="panel.alerts.roster.enable.tip">
                        <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind Enabled, Mode=OneWay}" />
                    </Button>

                    <Button Grid.Column="1"
                            Background="Transparent"
                            BorderThickness="0"
                            Padding="0,2"
                            CornerRadius="0"
                            HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                            HorizontalContentAlignment="Stretch"
                            Click="OnEventRowClick"
                            AutomationProperties.Name="{x:Bind Title}">
                        <Grid ColumnSpacing="8">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <FontIcon Grid.Column="0" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                      Glyph="{x:Bind IconGlyph}" FontSize="12"
                                      Foreground="{StaticResource EmberPrimaryBrush}"
                                      VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{x:Bind Title}"
                                       FontFamily="{StaticResource SansFont}" FontSize="10"
                                       FontWeight="SemiBold" CharacterSpacing="180"
                                       TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                                       Foreground="{StaticResource EmberPrimaryBrush}"
                                       VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{x:Bind TierCountText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="10"
                                       Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                                       VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                        </Grid>
                    </Button>
                </Grid>
            </DataTemplate>
        </ResourceDictionary>
    </UserControl.Resources>

    <Grid Background="{StaticResource CoalSurfaceBrush}">
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
            <RowDefinition Height="*" />
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

        <!-- ══════════════════ ROW 0 — HEADER BAND ══════════════════
             48 px, and it is the whole of the page's chrome. Everything on it is
             set from code-behind (AlertsView's ctor + SyncHeaderState):
               Title      "Alerts"
               IsOn       ViewModel.MasterEnabled — seeded, does not raise
               SetState   the AlertsService.PillState projection, unchanged
                          predicate, three words or fewer
               PrimaryCta "+ ADD TIER", the page's one brass verb -->
        <cmn:ToolPageHeader Grid.Row="0" x:Name="PageHeader" />

        <!-- ══════════════════ ROW 1 — TWO-COLUMN BODY ══════════════════ -->
        <Grid Grid.Row="1">
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                <!-- The live column is a fixed 300, not a share of the width: a
                     ten-row roster does not get wider with the window, and a
                     proportional right column stole space from the editor at
                     every size. -->
                <ColumnDefinition Width="300" />
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

            <!-- ───────────── LEFT * : the selected event family ─────────────
                 The pinned master-state banner that used to sit above this
                 scroller is gone (VM members and all) — it was the second of
                 three renderings of the master boolean; the header band
                 carries it now. -->
            <Grid Grid.Column="0">

                <!-- The detail pane's VISIBILITY is bound; its content is never
                     swapped or virtualized, so a focused TextBox stays in the
                     tree and commits its LostFocus edit before a roster click
                     changes the selection. -->
                <ScrollViewer x:Name="DetailScroll"
                              Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.DetailVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                              VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                              HorizontalScrollMode="Disabled">
                    <StackPanel Spacing="12" Padding="14">

                        <!-- The three-tile stat strip that used to be this
                             scroller's first child (EVENTS ENABLED / TIERS
                             CONFIGURED / ALERTS FIRED) is gone with no
                             replacement: 76 px of DisplayFont-26 reading
                             "0  0  0" on a fresh install, above the settings
                             someone opened the page to change. The one count
                             worth a glance is already in the live column's
                             header ("3 of 10 on"). -->

                        <!-- ── FAMILY ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
                        <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                            <StackPanel Spacing="10">
                                <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="2" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                        <TextBlock Text="EVENT FAMILY" Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.family.eyebrow" />
                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedEvent.Title, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                   FontFamily="{StaticResource DisplayFont}"
                                                   FontSize="18"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource CoalPaperBrush}"
                                                   TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <!-- CheckBox → TogglePill in a borderless Button host. -->
                                    <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                            Padding="0,4,10,4"
                                            Background="Transparent"
                                            BorderThickness="0"
                                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource Radius1Corner}"
                                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            Click="OnToggleEventEnabledClick"
                                            AutomationProperties.Name="Switch this event family on or off"
                                            loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.family.enable.a11y">
                                        <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedEvent.Enabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                        Label="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedEvent.EnabledLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                    </Button>
                                </Grid>

                                <!-- Raid-only: automatic Twitch shoutout for the raider.
                                     Visibility-gated, so it is invisible on nine of ten
                                     families exactly as before. -->
                                <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedEvent.AutoShoutoutVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                            Spacing="10">
                                    <Border Height="1" Background="{StaticResource CoalCardBrush}" />
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0"
                                                   Text="Auto-shoutout the raider (Twitch)"
                                                   Style="{StaticResource ToolSettingsLabelTextStyle}"
                                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.family.auto_shoutout.label" />
                                        <Button Grid.Column="1"
                                                Padding="0,4,10,4"
                                                Background="Transparent"
                                                BorderThickness="0"
                                                CornerRadius="{StaticResource Radius1Corner}"
                                                VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                Click="OnToggleAutoShoutoutClick"
                                                AutomationProperties.Name="Auto-shoutout the raider"
                                                loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.family.auto_shoutout.a11y">
                                            <cmn:TogglePill IsOn="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedEvent.AutoShoutout, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                            Label="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedEvent.AutoShoutoutLabel, Mode=OneWay}" />
                                        </Button>
                                    </Grid>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>

                        <!-- ── TOKENS ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
                        <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                            <StackPanel Spacing="4">
                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedEvent.TokenLine, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="11"
                                           Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                                           TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                <!-- One step under the token line (mono 11 → 10), same warm
                                     secondary — the house label/hint pairing. -->
                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedEvent.AmountHint, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>

                        <!-- ── SIZE TIERS ─────────────────────────────────── -->
                        <Border Style="{StaticResource ToolSectionCardStyle}">
                            <StackPanel Spacing="10">
                                <TextBlock Text="SIZE TIERS" Style="{StaticResource ToolEyebrowTextStyle}"
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.tiers.eyebrow" />

                                <ItemsRepeater ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedEvent.Tiers, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               cmn:RowDataContext.Supply="True"
                                               ItemTemplate="{StaticResource TierRowTemplate}"
                                               AutomationProperties.Name="Size tiers, lowest first"
                                               loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.tiers.list.a11y" />

                                <!-- Per-family empty state -->
                                <TextBlock Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.SelectedEvent.EmptyVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                           Text="No tiers yet — use ADD TIER above; From size 0 catches everything."
                                           loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.tiers.empty.body" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>

                    </StackPanel>
                </ScrollViewer>

                <!-- Empty state — a SIBLING of the scroller in the same cell,
                     never inside it. Two lines, no icon. -->
                <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind ViewModel.EmptyVisibility, Mode=OneWay}"
                            HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                            Spacing="8">
                    <TextBlock Text="No event family selected"
                               FontFamily="{StaticResource DisplayFont}"
                               FontSize="20"
                               Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                               loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.empty.title" />
                    <TextBlock Text="Pick one from the list on the right."
                               FontFamily="{StaticResource SansFont}"
                               FontSize="12"
                               Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                               loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.empty.body" />
                </StackPanel>
            </Grid>

            <!-- ───────────── RIGHT 300 : the family roster ─────────────
                 The ACTIVITY feed that used to close this column is gone. It is a
                 watch-surface element: what fired 40 seconds ago does not help
                 someone editing a From size, and on this page it was the fourth
                 place the tool's liveness got restated. -->
            <Border Grid.Column="1"
                    Background="{StaticResource CoalSurfaceBrush}"
                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalCardBrush}"
                    BorderThickness="1,0,0,0">
                <Grid>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />   <!-- header      -->
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />   <!-- column band -->
                        <RowDefinition Height="*" />      <!-- roster      -->
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />   <!-- rule note   -->
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                    <!-- The one legal PanelHeader in the house shell: the right
                         column's own header. -->
                    <cmn:PanelHeader Grid.Row="0" Eyebrow="LIVE" Title="Event responses"
                                     EyebrowKey="panel.common.eyebrow.live"
                                     TitleKey="panel.alerts.roster.title">
                        <cmn:PanelHeader.RightContent>
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RosterCountText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" FontSize="11"
                                       Foreground="{StaticResource CoalSecondaryTextBrush}"
                                       VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                        </cmn:PanelHeader.RightContent>
                    </cmn:PanelHeader>

                    <Border Grid.Row="1"
                            Background="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                            BorderThickness="0,0,0,1"
                            Padding="14,6">
                        <Grid ColumnSpacing="8">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="ON" Style="{StaticResource ToolColumnLabelTextStyle}"
                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.roster.column.on" />
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="EVENT" Style="{StaticResource ToolColumnLabelTextStyle}"
                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.roster.column.event" />
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="TIERS" Style="{StaticResource ToolColumnLabelTextStyle}"
                                       loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.roster.column.tiers" />
                        </Grid>
                    </Border>

                    <!-- Ten fixed families, so there is no roster empty state to
                         build: the list is never empty. -->
                    <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="2"
                                  VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                                  HorizontalScrollMode="Disabled">
                        <ItemsRepeater ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.Events, Mode=OneWay}"
                                       cmn:RowDataContext.Supply="True"
                                       ItemTemplate="{StaticResource EventRowTemplate}"
                                       AutomationProperties.Name="Event families"
                                       loc:Localize.AutomationKey="panel.alerts.roster.list.a11y" />
                    </ScrollViewer>

                    <!-- The matching rule, kept from the old page intro; it belongs
                         under the roster it describes. -->
                    <Border Grid.Row="3"
                            Background="{StaticResource CoalRaisedBrush}"
                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource CoalDividerBrush}"
                            BorderThickness="0,1,0,0"
                            Padding="14,6">
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ToolMonoHintTextStyle}"
                                   Text="Each event picks the highest matching size tier, posts its chat line and can fire an overlay trigger."
                                   loc:Localize.Key="panel.alerts.roster.rule.hint" />
                    </Border>
                </Grid>
            </Border>
        </Grid>
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
